{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>נוע</b> — in the manner of: והמה יניעון לאכול (and they wander to eat)." "<b>ושאלו</b> — a heavy verb (Piel), like שאל ישאלו (1 Samuel 20:14)." "<b>ודרשו</b> — like ושאלו, that they seek bread." "<b>And the sense of מחרבותיהם</b> — that they will dwell in ruins."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 109, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:13.496555231Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}